sequenceDiagram
    participant CL as Chainlink Aggregator<br/>(Base Sepolia)
    participant RN as Reactive Network
    participant CMR as ChainlinkMirrorReactive<br/>(Lasna)
    participant REL as Relayer Network
    participant AFP as AbstractFeedProxy<br/>(Sepolia)
    participant DApp as Frontend/dApp
    
    Note over CL,DApp: Oracle Bridge Data Flow
    
    rect rgb(40, 60, 80)
        Note over CL,CMR: Phase 1: Event Detection
        CL->>CL: Price Update
        CL->>RN: Emit AnswerUpdated(answer, roundId, updatedAt)
        RN->>RN: Match subscription filters
        RN->>CMR: Deliver log to react()
    end
    
    rect rgb(60, 40, 80)
        Note over CMR,REL: Phase 2: Reactive Processing
        CMR->>CMR: Validate log.chain_id
        CMR->>CMR: Validate log._contract
        CMR->>CMR: Validate log.topic_0
        CMR->>CMR: Decode AnswerUpdated data
        CMR->>CMR: Construct callback payload
        CMR->>REL: Emit Callback(destChain, destContract, payload)
    end
    
    rect rgb(80, 60, 40)
        Note over REL,DApp: Phase 3: Cross-Chain Delivery
        REL->>REL: Pick up Callback event
        REL->>AFP: Execute updateFromBridge(roundId, answer, timestamps)
        AFP->>AFP: Verify msg.sender == authorizedRvmId
        AFP->>AFP: Store round data
        AFP->>AFP: Emit AnswerUpdated event
    end
    
    rect rgb(40, 80, 60)
        Note over AFP,DApp: Phase 4: Data Consumption
        DApp->>AFP: latestRoundData()
        AFP-->>DApp: Return (roundId, answer, startedAt, updatedAt, answeredInRound)
    end
